# The dispatch contract of nluca's generated_step (fuller safety::Contract,
# the format of tests/corpus/nluca/nluca.contract, from noctiluca-dev
# rust/nluca/src/gpu.rs and results/nluca/cases/README.md): one thread a
# row, a 1-D dispatch of ceil(width / X) workgroups of the kernel's own
# width X over at most 1,048,576 rows (at most 1,048,576 workgroups, X = 1);
# the width (ints[0], buffer_5) and the band's first row
# (offset[0], buffer_6) are at most 2^20. The legality checker's layer 7
# proves a kernel of this problem under it.
workgroups x 1 1048576
workgroups y 1 1
workgroups z 1 1
param buffer_5_global[0] 0 1048576
param buffer_6_global[0] 0 1048576
